  "bearing_model": "The dry contact model uses coefficient 0.55, gravity-loaded free boards, loose tins and precompressed cloth. The two solvers exchange board poses and contact forces. Bearing faces on fixed furniture are the level patches measured on source meshes. All four car-ramp seats must stay under their respective board. Cabinet and coffee-table joinery is fixed.",
